<title>FRANCE: EU grain exports end season near 27 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>EU grain exports end season near 27 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union ended the 1996/97 season with grain exports of nearly 27 milllion tonnes, EU figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Exports and imports were again little changed in the week to June 30, with most exports frozen by the European Commission.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
